window.products.push({"id":678067,"name":"LIFETOOLS-LT 3 Layer Heart Cake Pan Silicone Mold(8-inch) Set, Baking Bakeware Tray for Romantic Day, Make for Multilayer Cake, Pie, Tart & Quiche; 7A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XIH--VjYL._AC_SL1029_.jpg","description":"Add fun to your life, Enjoy DIY!Package includes:3*heart-shape cake panFeatures:Food-grade siliconeEasy to Clean, can be washed in the dishwasher;Reuse without deformation, no fading;Sweets can be popped out easily. Create a good DIY Experience.Use and maintenance1. It is best to apply a little butter or oil before making.2. When baked silicone mold should be open in a baking tray.Do not bake it empty.If you only use part of it, please add other parts with water.3. When baking finish, please remove the pan from the oven out, and place the bakery products in the cold rack until completely cold.4. Don't rinse with cold water immediately after out of the oven, to prolong service life.5. After each use, wash in the dishwasher or use hot water to clean.Make sure the silicone mold before each use and dry completely before storage.6. The silicon mold can be used only for the oven, oven and microwave oven, never can be used directly on the gas stove and induction cooker, or direct heating use.7. Do not use the knife or other sharp instruments on the silicone mold, not weight, pulling.8. The silicone mold dust absorption, easily. Long time need not when, put in the carton, placed in the shade.Note: Due to the display, camera, or other factors, there may be some chromatic aberration. Please refer to the physical product.Tips:1. Prevent sharp objects from scratching2. Direct contact with open flames and heating tubes is strictly prohibited100% Satisfaction Guarantee - Feel free to contact us if you have any questions about the item. All issues will be solved within 24 hours.Click \"Add to Cart\" now to create your own special desserts and enjoy them with your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XIH--VjYL._AC_SL1029_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFETOOLS-LT","source_asin":"B07Z9FYC7W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z9FYC7W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z9FYC7W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
