window.products.push({"id":678183,"name":"HOME-X Stainless Steel Meatball Maker Spoons, Perfect Meatball Scooper, Dishwasher Safe, 2-Piece Set, 9 ½\" L x 2 ½\" W and 8\" L x 1 ½\", Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dCh4enePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To get the perfect meatball every time, you need to have the right tools in your kitchen. Our meatball scooping tool is the ideal way to get consistent meatballs every time. Ground beef, chicken, or sausage can make delicious meatballs. Just season your meat as desired, then press the bowl of the spoon into the ground meat. Release the pressure, use the small scoop to easily remove the meat from the scoop, and you’ll have a perfectly round little meatball. Meatballs are a delicious and versatile food, making them ideal for picky eaters and weekly dinners. They're also great for appetizers or side dishes at parties or get-togethers with friends and family. oo often, people don't have the time to shape each meatball—this time-saving scoop will have your meatballs prepped and in the oven or on the stovetop in no time at all. Mix them with spaghetti noodles, throw them on some bread for a hearty meatball sandwich, or serve them with a delicious vegetable dish. You really can't go wrong with our stainless-steel scoop and spoon set. Get ready to enjoy delicious, stress-free dinners every night of the week with the HOME-X Meatball Maker Spoon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dCh4enePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08HN89H8Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HN89H8Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HN89H8Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
