window.products.push({"id":678251,"name":"G.a HOMEFAVOR Hanging Spice Rack For Wall Mount, Single Tier Mesh Storage Organizer, Spice Racks Space Saving for Kitchen Cabinet, Cupboard or Pantry ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-3apWmCDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superior Material】The wall mounted spice rack is made of thick iron wire, to make it more stable and durable. Black stoving varnish surface that’s rust-proof, water-proof, and can last for a long time, don’t worry about the spice rack getting rusty in wet environments such as bathrooms and kitchens. 【Stackable Design】4 single-tier wall spice rack can be stacked together. And it is characterized by its superior flexibility. Hang the spices organizer together or individually and vary the distance between the spice rack shelves. 【Large Capacity】Size: 16.3(L) x 2.6(W) x 6.3(H) inches. Each hanging spice rack is perfect for the spice jars with wide less than or equal to 2.3 inches. ​Keep your seasoning perfectly organized with the wall-mounted spice rack. (Warmly tip: The spice jars are not included.) 【Easy to Install】 Our spice rack organizer comes with 2 screws. It is in total 8 pcs screws and 8 pcs wall anchors. The spice rack is easy to install on the wall in the kitchen cabinet, cupboard, countertop, or pantry door, maximizing your storage space. Or you can use the adhesive hook instead (Warmly tip: The adhesive hooks are not included) 【Multi-Functional】The spice racks can be moved and installed in almost any location including the kitchen, pantry, or even other rooms in the house. Perfect for spices, medicine bottles, cotton pads, facial cleansers, toners, face creams, body lotions, scrub creams, essential oils, nail polishes, and other small jars in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-3apWmCDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G.a HOMEFAVOR","source_asin":"B09DP862K8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DP862K8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DP862K8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
