window.products.push({"id":678380,"name":"Purse Hanger for Closet 10 Pack, Metal S Hook Hooks for Hanging Purses, Handbags, Backpacks, Belts, Scraves, Hats, Clothes - Black S Hook, Hook for Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W5x+KxpXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Why Choose Our metal hooks for hanging: ✔Thoughtful rubber cover design, no need to worry about rusting even in outdoor use. ✔Our handbag hangers are hard and sturdy, not easily damaged or deformed. ✔It can also be used to organize various clothing accessories or tools, display plants or organize kitchen utensils and so on. LARGE SIZE CLOSET ROD HOOKS: - Suitable for rod diameter1.6inch - One opening size is 1.7inch, another opening size is 1.8inch, it fits all regular closet rods less than 1.6inch thickness.Hold up to 22lb, strong and durable. VINYL COATED HOOKS: Handbag hanger made of premium steel material with a soft rubber coating on the surface. Sturdy and has no sharp edges. Rubber stoppers on both sides prevent your stuff from slipping to the floor while avoiding scratching items and hands. MULTIFUNCTIONAL S HOOKS: S-shaped hooks can be used to hang clothes, pants, bags, belts, ties, hats, scarves, towels, pots, pans, cups, kitchen utensils, Christmas wreaths, plant baskets, tools, and so on. Purse hanger is suitable for the bathroom, kitchen, garage, storage room, office, etc. Our purse hooks are made of quality steel material with soft rubber coated on surface, which make it soft to prevent bags from scratches. Just the simple way these hooks are oriented makes organizing handbags in the closet so much easier and nicer. Organize your kitchen space by hanging your pots, pans, bowls, spatulas, cups, and other kitchen utensils on your shelves or pot racks, making your cooking more efficient and easy on our kitchen hooks. Organize your closet by hanging scarves, purses, hats, belts, jeans, jewelry, and more on our small s hook. Organize tools in the garage, hang toiletries, towels, and robes in the bathroom, and hang wind chimes or plants in your garden by using our s hangers hooks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W5x+KxpXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BDRSDD42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678380","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRSDD42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRSDD42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
