window.products.push({"id":678427,"name":"Moonshan Liquid Filling Machine 1-118 Oz Bottle Filler Machine Bottling Diaphragm Pump Digital Control for Liquid, Juice, Wine, MCT Oil, Cosmetic Oil,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlRmUV8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Please tear off the protective film on the stainless steel surface before using】【118 Fl Oz/min Diaphragm Pump】Choosing a liquid filling machine is actually choosing pumps. This liquid filling machine adopts a large flow rate internal return diaphram pump, which is powerful and super cost-effective. And its maximum flow rate can reach 118oz/min (=3500ml/min), error ≤±1%, more suitable for filling amount > 1 Fl Oz(=30ml). * Diaphragm pump filling low volume liquid will have large error. 【Upgraded Components and Warranty】Even though liquid filling machines look and function similarly, the pumps and components inside are completely different. Casing of our bottle filling machine is made of more durable stainless steel. Our liquid filling machines are upgraded thoroughly, not only the material and components, but better assembly process thanks to years of experience. What's more, we provide each customer with 1-YEAR warranty and lifetime technical support. 【7 Groups of Data Saving and Automatic Working】Cored with an intelligent control board, seven groups of setting can be stored, recall your desired filling settings without worrying changing different volumes. Continuous mode(Automatic mode) and inching mode(manual mode) switchable. And this filler machine has an automatic bottle counting function to efficiently speed up your small batch production. 【Compact Design and Convenient Operation】This liquid filling machine only weighs 5 Lbs and can be easily held be one person. Tight size but powerful function. Get rid of pedal, press the red button on panel to trigger every filling process.Take it anywhere to plug it on and improve your work efficiency. 【Wide Application】This bottling machine is suitable for low viscosity liquid, being non-corrosive, non-viscous, and particle-free, alcohol content<40%. It can be widely used for filling water, beer, juice, wine, MCT based tincture, cosmetic oil, glass detergent, etc. Thick olive oil is not suitable. It is an ideal equipment for small batch filling or as a supplement to the automatic production line in factories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xlRmUV8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moonshan","source_asin":"B08YDG7X7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDG7X7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDG7X7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
