window.products.push({"id":678550,"name":"BIRGILT Best Sister Ever - Sister Gifts from Sister - Funny Secret Sister Birthday Mothers Day Gifts Ideas for Big Sister Women Little Girls - 20oz Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GeD31i5ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sister Gifts from Sister - Let everyone know that your sister is fabulous and one of your best friends also! Our sister tumbler is the perfect gifts ideas for sister, big sister, best sister, little sister, new sister, twin sister, dear sister, dog sister, dance sister, navy sister, step-sister, besties, female, like a sister or any fabulous in your life. Sister Gifts for Many Occasions - Each tumbler comes individually gift boxed. Tumbler with the funny saying, “Best Sister Ever” print on the front. Funny sister gifts from sister for those with a sense of humor our versatile drink cup is great for sharing in good times and creating new memories. A perfect gift for her Birthday, Christmas, graduation, bridal shower, a special occasion, or any time she needs to know how much you love her! Stay Hot or Stay Cold - The high-quality stainless steel and the double-walled insulation design ensures beverage can stay either hot or cold over time. which can help maintain the temperature of your drink for a long time and protects your hands against the temperature when you choose our sister tumbler. Unique Lids - Features two unique lids to choose from when enjoying your beverage. New Slider Lid is fast and simple to use. It was inspired by the millions of coffee drinkers that enjoy sipping on their drinks quickly.The Slider Lid helps prevent splashing and spilling which allows you to enjoy your drink safely. Premium Material & BPA Free – These tumblers also come with a convenient reusable drink straw, straw cleaning brush, and BPA-free drink lid. Crafted with 18/8 food-grade stainless steel these tumblers are durable, Gently fits into your hand with an Anti-Sweat design. The 20 oz tumbler lightweight and compact feel make it easy to fit into most car cup holders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GeD31i5ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIRGILT","source_asin":"B08SQ8P8WX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678550","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SQ8P8WX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SQ8P8WX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":678551,"name":"OJF Hot Air Fryer,4.2 Quart Electric Air Fryers Cooker with Dual Temperature and Time Knob Control,Easy to Use Oil-Free Air Fryer,1300W,Tray,Food Tong","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713PchKXr7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍗[A quick solution for cooking with less oil]This OJF air fryer with 360° fast hot air circulation technology cooks very evenly & fast and reheats great.It uses up to 85% less fat at least while keeping the same crispy taste as traditional deep frying.This really helps you get rid of fat that we all hate.You can air fry,roast,grill,toast and bake all in one air fryer with no hassle or no mess. 🍗[Incredibly easy to use]This knob control air fryer is equipped with two dials to adjust the temperature in Celsius from 80 to 200℃ and time from 0 to 30 minutes. On top of the air fryer there is a wide array of food options with a suggested time,which helps you know the temperature and time easily.Set it up,then just forget it and do other stuff meanwhile.Come back and enjoy your meals after you hear a ring. 🍗[Safe to use] Non-slip feet,cool-touch handle and safety over heating protection help you to use air fryer safely.The power will cut off automatically when you pull out the basket to check the food,and it will continue to work after you push the pot back.The nonstick coating material is also food grade.FDA and ETL certificated 🍗[Super easy to clean]Cleaning the air fryer after cooking was ridiculously simple.The non-stick detachable basket tray is dishwasher safe as well or you can simply clean it with a mild sponge and dishwashing liquid. 🍗[Enough capacity for daily cooking]The dimension of this air fryer is 11.8x14.5x13.6 inches (handle included).It's a high-capacity air fryer and its 4.2 quart size is large enough to actually cook an entree for several people in one go.The design of this machine is pretty minimalist with a black shiny design that should fit in most kitchens. In the package:1*air fryer,1*food tong,1*basket tray,1*user manual,1*recipe book,1*gift box.1300W,120V/Hz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713PchKXr7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OJF","source_asin":"B097JBXMQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678551","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097JBXMQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097JBXMQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
