window.products.push({"id":678637,"name":"Vacplus Moisture Absorbers, Efficient Humidity Packs for Bathrooms, Basements, Rvs, Premium Closet Dehumidifier 24 Pack, 0.88oz Each, Fragrance-Free G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p1MSm+c9L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"EFFICIENT ABSORPTION: Vacplus moisture absorbers feature a highly absorbent formula. The main ingredients are spherical calcium chloride and resin powder, which can quickly absorb excess moisture. It is normal that the calcium chloride will become gel when combined with water vapor in the air. EASY TO USE: These safe moisture absorbers are simple to use. All you need to do is remove the package and place them in the desired spots. Remember to keep the absorbent side facing up. Just replace the used bag with a new pack when the calcium chloride is solidified. FRAGRANCE-FREE & GREEN: No artificial fragrances added, Vacplus dehumidifier bags are fragrance-free and safe to use. They can not only effectively dehumidify but also prevent the musty odors from emerging caused by the excess moisture. Keep the space dry and fresh all the time. WIDE APPLICATION: Designed in a compact size, Vacplus moisture removers are ideal for different locations, such as cars, RVs, kitchens, closets, laundry rooms, basements, closets, and other enclosed spaces. The more airtight the space is, the better dehumidifying effect is. LONG-TERM USE: Being individually packed, these humidity absorbers are easy to use and store. A whole bag contains 24 packs of Vacplus odor absorbers which can last up to 240 days in total. (Duration will vary depending on temperature and humidity). And please remember to keep the bag sealed after each opening.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p1MSm+c9L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vacplus","source_asin":"B09WDRQQGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDRQQGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDRQQGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
