window.products.push({"id":678648,"name":"ZEUS Combo Brush & Comb Set - Double-Sided Sandalwood Comb & 100% Boar Bristle Brush (SOFT), Grooming Beards & Mustaches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6190wfPpmlL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"WHAT’S IN THE BOX: Our Zeus Sandalwood and Pear Wood Brush Set includes the following: (1) Zeus Palm Beard Brush – G92 (measuring: Length: 4 1/3\" | Width: 1 1/8\" | Bristle Height: 7/10\") and (1) Zeus Organic Sandalwood Double-Sided Beard Comb – R31 (measuring: Length: 3.875\" | Teeth length: 0.75\") BOAR BRISTLE BRUSH (G92): The handle was created with European sourced Pear Wood with 100% second-cut Boar Bristle Hairs which provides the softness for the brush. The second-cut bristles are meant to be soft yet effective enough to attract and remove dirt from your beard while smoothing your facial hairs. The Pear Wood is top quality and won’t warp its life with you while the boar bristles are great for those with short beards, sensitive skin, or thinner type facial hair DOUBLE-SIDED ORGANIC SANDALWOOD COMB (R31): Our Sandalwood Comb features a smooth, hand-polished body accentuates the natural wood grain that runs through the comb. In your hand, you feel a perfect balance of heft and lightness. The organic material is sturdy and aromatic and benefits both your hair and skin. The fine teeth side is best for removing tangles and straightening strands while the medium teeth is best for quick touch ups. It’s the best of both worlds due to the double-sided teeth. BOAR BRISTLE INFORMATION: There are many types of beard brushes out there in the market but make sure you get quality brushes since it’s going directly on your face. Our beard brush is made in Germany using European sourced Pear Wood, giving our brush a warp resistant handle. The soft boar bristles massages rather than scratch your skin and it attracts and removes dirt from your beard keeping it clean while smoothing your facial hairs. SANDALWOOD INFORMATION: The organic and hand carved comb provides you with a sturdy and aromatic material that benefits both your hair and skin. The natural material is perfect for those who want an alternative to plastics. A smooth, hand-polished body accentuates the natural wood grain that runs through the comb. In your hand, you feel a perfect balance of heft and lightness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6190wfPpmlL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEUS","source_asin":"B01N6QYL0X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N6QYL0X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N6QYL0X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
