window.products.push({"id":678678,"name":"Yihui Arts Nautical Canvas Wall Art Hand Painted Navy Blue and White Coastal Painting Modern Abstract Tree Artwork for Living Room Bedroom Hall Way De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1oI5ScK6TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE Hand Painted Nautical Canvas Wall Art: 20x20IN (50x50CM) Hand Painted Nautical Canvas Wall Art By Professional Artist, With Good 3D Textured . It's Not Canvas Print. GALLERY WRAPPED CANVAS. This Hand Painted Nautical Canvas Wall Art is wrapped around a traditional wood frame for a gallery-worthy look, with hanger included, Is ready to hang. PERFECT WALL DECOR IDEA. Hand Painted Nautical Canvas Wall Art is perfect for your living room, dining room, bedroom, bathroom, office and so on. The beautiful 3D Texture Wall Art will catch lot of attention. It's great as an gift idea. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE. We provide 100% Satisfaction Money-Back Guarantee for this Hand Painted White Flower Canvas Wall Art. Please send us messages if any questions, all of message reply in 11 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1oI5ScK6TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yihui Arts","source_asin":"B093T36V5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093T36V5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093T36V5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":678679,"name":"EMMA + OLIVER Multi-Position Stitched Recliner/Ottoman with Swivel Base in Vintage LeatherSoft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":429.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818Mwp2tvGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you're looking for the perfect place to relax and unwind then this brown vintage lever recliner and ottoman set is calling your name. Featuring thickly padded arms and tastefully exposed wood frames this recliner chair and ottoman blends seamlessly in any decor. Soft and durable Leathersoft upholstery over a plush back and seat padded with CAL 117 fire retardant foam makes this chair the perfect place to end a long day. This living room recliner not only has great looks but is thoroughly adjustable to fit your needs. This uniquely designed recliner features a ball-bearing swivel mahogany base that makes turning from one conversation to another effortless. The convenient lever gives you infinite adjustment angles to ease back pain, relieve pressure from your spine and cradle you in comfort. This set is not only perfect in the home, but makes for a great addition in the office. Floor glides will protect your hard flooring surfaces when you want to move this recliner and ottoman.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818Mwp2tvGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EMMA + OLIVER","source_asin":"B08Q1WL2KW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678679","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q1WL2KW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q1WL2KW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":678680,"name":"Mattress Solution Split Fully Assembled Bunkie Board for Mattress/Bed Support, Twin, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51juvKQXL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 1.5-inch Bunkie Board , Split Bunkie Board provides a surface foundation for any platform beds, bunks and daybeds. It adds support to the mattress and will keep mattress stay in good shape thus extending the life of your mattress. It will give a firm bottom support for the mattress and raises the mattress up for about 1.5 inches. When a mattress is placed directly on slats or metal spring, the mattress will have the tendency to rip or sink. These can be avoided with the use of a Bunkie board. Using a Bunkie board doubles the mattress' life expectancy. This Bunkie board is a good alternative in lieu of a box spring that may be too high for day beds. It will give the bed a lift without adding much height. This Bunkie board is strong enough to be used directly on bed frame in lieu of a box spring. It will give the mattress a lift which is a quite low but will definitely hold up the mattress. It is wrapped in a stitch bonded nonwoven fabric. It meets federal standards 1632 and 1633 fire code. This Bunkie Board will give you enduring comfort and durability for an excellent sleep. The split design will give you the convenience and easy mobility since the 2 piece varieties are very light weight utilizing 2 smaller pieces making them easier to carry and maneuver through the cramped quarters of an apartment our house. continuously aims to be the most reliable direct mattress manufacturer in the industry. With our prominent name and superior service, we satisfy customers all over. All of our products are made in the Country to ensure that you get only the best. We take great pride in the quality of our products and the quick service we provide. Our customers are our best advertisement. Customers and business partners alike have experienced Company's commitment to the unbeatable service we provide for their high quality products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51juvKQXL8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mattress Solution","source_asin":"B0BNQZ4DD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQZ4DD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQZ4DD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
