window.products.push({"id":678754,"name":"KESS InHouse Anneline Sophia\"Day of the Dead\" Blue Aztec Artistic Apron, 31 by 35.75\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hIeCjTlyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cook up a storm with artistic flare and protect your clothes with these KESS InHouse aprons! Made of durable, machine washable poly-canvas, these aprons measure 31 x 35.75 inches and will cover you from all kitchen mishaps. Stain resistant, these bold and colorful aprons are great for outdoor grilling, BBQs, baking and all culinary creations. Also great for clean up ranging from the kitchen table all the way up to household chores, as well as from home improvement projects such as painting and staining. Ties in the back for easy wear, and show off your flare for the bold and unique. At KESS InHouse, we see home decor as a chance to add art to the home and to bring together a collaborative community of artists. Whether it's on the couch, in the kitchen or hanging from a wall, we believe that art enriches our lives and we want to support the artists who make it possible. For this reason, a percentage of every KESS InHouse sale goes back to the artist who created the design. KESS InHouse curates every piece of artwork specifically keeping in mind the product line. We pride ourselves on the quality and integrity of our company and home decor line. KESS InHouse believes artists should be rewarded for their creativity, imagination, and ability to transform a blank surface into something remarkable. We would like to invite you to join us in our fight against blank walls and creatively lacking homes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hIeCjTlyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KESS InHouse","source_asin":"B00ZXEDJBU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZXEDJBU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZXEDJBU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":678755,"name":"Prodyne Grape Embossed Champagne/Wine Bucket, Tulip Shape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y81xCElXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Our elegant embossed grape acrylic wine bucket is perfect for all occasions. Has a 3-1/2-quart capacity and measures 8-1/55-inch deep by 8-1/55-inch high. Amazon.com This high-sided, flat-bottomed vessel holds flowers from the garden, but it really is best suited for a wine bottle on ice. Why else would bunches of frosty-looking grapes adorn it? The little handles, shaped like ram's horns, are convenient for toting the bowl from kitchen to table, and the tough acrylic walls will survive rough handling--it could be used poolside or in the park without worrying about broken glass. But don't scrub it with a scratchy pad. --Patricia Draher","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y81xCElXS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prodyne","source_asin":"B00004SW3I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SW3I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SW3I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":678756,"name":"Cherrypark High Stretch Couch Cover for 2 Cushion Couch Universal Waterproof 2 Seat Sofa Covers Non Slip Sofa Slipcovers with Elastic Hem Living Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tJ9H9r0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.WATERPROOF FEATURE: All of our sofa covers are made of high quality, water-resistant fabric that are durable and can make your furniture fresher and tidy. The upgraded waterproof fabric of the magic sofa cover features a water repellent and stain resistant finish, providing a full protaction against any accidental spills. Accidental splashing will form water droplets on the surface of the sofa slipcover, you don't have to worry about staining your sofa if you wipe it off immediately. 2.HIGH STRECH FABRIC: Our couch cover for 1/2/3/4 cushion couch are made of stretchy 85% polyester and 15% spandex blend fabric with a soft texture for a luxury look, which also make our fitted sofa protectors best suitable for many types of sofas. Our sofa slipcovers can instantly put family rooms and living rooms in a vacation state of mind which also brings feeling of breathable, skin-friendly, smooth and soft to the touch. 3.STYLISH: Get a new look for your sofa with these magic sofa covers. Cherrypark sofa slipcovers are designed in full solid color, which can complement any decoration of your room and add elegance to your furniture and home decoration. This couch cover uses environmentally friendly dyeing, which is environmentally friendly and not easy to fade. The vibrant colors will last for a long time and add a unique and luxurious atmosphere to your living room. 4.EASY TO USE: The detailed picture of our sofa cover includes the installation drawing, and we also put the installation guide in the package. Just follow them and you can install these slipcovers effortlessly by yourself in ten minutes. You can choose either machine wash or hand wash. Use gentle water for machine wash or hand wash. Tumble dry or line dry. Note: Please be careful that these sofa covers cannot be ironed or bleached. 5.SIZE CHOOSE: In order to choose the right size for your sofa, please measure your furniture size before ordering.X-Large size can fit the length between 92-118 inches, Large size can fit the length between 72-92 inches, Medium size can fit the length between 57-70 inches while small size can fit the length between 32-47 inches. Normally you will enjoy our pet furniture protectors, while if you have any concerns or you just want to return, please feel free to send email to us on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tJ9H9r0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cherrypark","source_asin":"B09YM3Z7PS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YM3Z7PS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YM3Z7PS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
