window.products.push({"id":678899,"name":"Spare Essentials (55 Pack) 7 inch Aluminum Baking Pan, Round Aluminum Pans with Clear Lids, Takeout Containers Freezer & Oven Safe, Food Containers wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zEq7-7R6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❶BEST VALUE: Foil food containers in bulk pack. Foil Pie Pans made with sturdy foil that will perform excellent in the kitchen, size 7’’. Durable and convenient foil pans 55 pans, perfect for baking, cooking, fridge or freezer and transfer. Disposable take-out containers are essential supplies in almost any foodservice establishment. Each pack comes with 55 aluminum rounded pans and 55 plastic lids. Dimensions/ Size: 7 inches. ❷BAKERY STYLE: Useful pie tins with lids. To enjoy crusty, hearty, and deeply flavored pies, cakes and quiche tarts. With these premium Aluminum Foil Pie Pans NOW you can create all this at home! Also, used by kitchen staff members to package up foods for individual purchase, bulk retail, or catering applications. ❸QUALITY PANS: Made from thick gauge, heavy duty, aluminum foil. Heats food evenly providing excellent performance that browns beautifully! Tasty delicious and good looking tarts! Pie lids at your convenience. ❹EASY CLEANUP & DISPOSABLE: With this tin plates you can save or share leftovers without worrying about getting your aluminum tray back! Dispose of the foil packaging when you don’t feel like cleaning! Disposable Tart Pans are the choice. ❺OVEN TO FREEZER MEALS: These pans are freezer-safe and can be used for baking and storing frozen desserts and savory meals. - AIR FRYER COMPATIBLE: Round tins help to promote even cooking in an air fryer, as they allow hot air to circulate around the food. This helps to ensure that the food is evenly cooked and that it cooks through completely. With this food packaging you can cook a variety of foods in an air fryer. They are lightweight and compact, which makes them easy to move around and store when not in use. - TAKEAWAY AND THROW AWAY: Aluminum foil round pans are also great for takeaway and throw away use. They are disposable, making them easy to use and clean up after. - BULK PACKAGING: The 7 inch round pans with lids are available in bulk packaging, making them an ideal choice for those who need to purchase large quantities. - FOOD BUSINESS PROVIDERS: These pans are also suitable for commercial use, such as in restaurants and bakeries. They are designed to withstand oven and freezer temperatures. They are freezer-safe and can be used for baking and storing frozen desserts. They are also ideal for use in buffet and catering settings, as they are easy to transport and can be used to serve a variety of dishes. - HAPPY HOLLIDAYS CHOICE! 4th of July and summer holiday baking, Thanksgiving and Christmas holiday pies. Disposable cake pan for easy cakes and brownies baking. Our 7 inch pie tins will make it easy to share delicious baking with the ones you love. Tart pans that are also perfect for any occasion: take-out, delivery businesses, picnics, deli's, schools, camps, medical facilities, cooking classes, pie eating contests and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zEq7-7R6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spare Essentials","source_asin":"B07YMKSM4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YMKSM4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YMKSM4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":678900,"name":"Bodum Kenya 48-Ounce Coffee Press, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B5KXS4WRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Nice design with improved durability is a nice way to describe the Kenya Coffee Press. Brewing coffee in a press is one of the best ways to brew coffee. Just add the appropriate amount of coarse ground coffee (we recommend one scoop for every 4 ounce of water), fill with hot water, set the lid and plunger in place, wait 4 minutes , then press and enjoy. The water, which was just off a boil, has the best extraction capabilities. Combined with the time and lack of paper filter to soak up the essential oil and acids, pressing provided you with a well rounded flavorful cup of coffee. Brewing is easy and cleanup is easy too. Just scoop the used grounds in to you compost or garbage and rinse. The Kenya 12 Cup is 48 ounce and yields 12 - 4 ounce cups of coffee. The 12 cup size is great for entertaining. Amazon.com The French press is considered by many coffee aficionados to be the best way to make a perfect cup of coffee because no paper filter absorbs the essence of the flavor. Bodums Kenya line features the same elegant glass carafe as its original Chambord press, but handsomely employs heat-resistant, lightweight polypropylene for the lid and one-piece handle and cradle. To make coffee with a French press, remove the plunger/top ensemble, add coarse ground coffee to the glass carafe, add hot (but not boiling) water, stir with a non-metal spoon, and position the top and plunger in place. Allow the coffee to brew for about four minutes before slowing pushing down on the plunger. Pushing too hard or too quickly may cause hot liquid to squirt out. The flat lid features two spout covers: one slotted for pouring, and one solid for heat and aroma retention. When holding the handle, hands are thoughtfully protected from the hot glass by a vertical bar of the heat-resistant cradle. To clean, simply scoop out the used grounds and pop the entire unit into the dishwasher. A plastic coffee measuring spoon is included. This 48-ounce model makes twelve four-ounce cups of coffee. Made in Denmark, the press measures 8-3/4 by 6-1/2 inches and is also available in other sizes. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B5KXS4WRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bodum","source_asin":"B0000CFED9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFED9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFED9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":678901,"name":"Bush Furniture Stanford 48\" Computer Desk Set in Antique Black and Hansen Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZFPPTQV7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Fairview Computer Desk with Drawers in Antique Black - Engineered Wood (included quantity: 1) Blend style and functionality in your home office with the Bush Furniture Fairview Computer Desk with Drawers in Antique Black. With a durable and charming Hansen Cherry top surface, the Computer Desk has room to spare as you surf the net or spread out paperwork. Stack electronics or books on the convenient knee-well shelf, and set up your keyboard or laptop on the drawer with a drop-down front. Keep office supplies at your fingertips thanks to the built-in box drawer, and get organized with a closed storage compartment to keep your work surface in order. Fairview meets ANSI/SOHO quality test standards for performance and safety and comes with a Bush Furniture 6 Year Manufacturer's Warranty. With casual styling and traditional detail, Fairview offers an alluring appearance without sacrificing functionality. See the full collection for coordinating home and office items available.Features :- Durable, scratch-resistant Hansen Cherry work surface complements the Antique Black finish- Handy drawer with drop-down front works as keyboard or laptop shelf- Large vertical closed storage space features wire access- Knee-well shelf creates open storage space for electronics or books- Box drawer houses office supplies- Antique Pewter hardware adds a beautiful touch- Fairview Collection blends traditional detail with contemporary functionality- Meets ANSI/SOHO quality test standards for performance and safety- Comes with Bush Furniture 6 Year Manufacturer's Warranty- Material: Engineered Wood- Product Color: Antique Black/Hansen Cherry.Specifications :- Assembly Required : Yes- Warranty : 1 Year- Product Color : Antique Black and Hansen Cherry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ZFPPTQV7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B0044D3JTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-678901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0044D3JTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0044D3JTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
